CSS — Taariikh, Ujeeddo iyo Xog Muhiim ah
1. Waa maxay CSS?
CSS (Cascading Style Sheets) waa luuqad lagu qeexo muuqaalka HTML: midabbada, cabbirrada qoraalka, kala-fogaanshaha, layouts iyo sida boggu ula qabsado shaashado kala duwan.
2. Taariikhda CSS
- 1994: Håkon Wium Lie wuxuu soo jeediyay fikradda CSS si content-ka iyo design-ka loo kala saaro.
- 1996: W3C wuxuu soo saaray CSS Level 1 (CSS1).
- 1998: CSS Level 2 (CSS2) ayaa la daabacay.
- 2011: CSS 2.1 wuxuu noqday W3C Recommendation.
- 2000-meeyadii ilaa maanta: CSS waxaa loo horumariyaa modules kala duwan, sida Selectors, Flexbox, Grid iyo Media Queries; ma jiro hal heer oo rasmi ah oo la yidhaahdo “CSS3” oo wada daboolaya dhammaan CSS.
3. Maxaa CSS loo isticmaalaa?
1. In bogga loo sameeyo midab iyo fonts qurux badan.
2. In la habeeyo margin, padding iyo borders.
3. In layouts loo sameeyo Flexbox iyo Grid.
4. In website-ku noqdo responsive (mobile, tablet iyo desktop).
5. In la sameeyo hover effects, transitions iyo animations.
6. In la ilaaliyo design isku mid ah bogag badan iyadoo la isticmaalayo stylesheet dibadeed.
4. Saddexda hab ee CSS loo qoro
- Inline CSS: style attribute gudaha HTML element.
- Internal CSS: <style> gudaha HTML document.
- External CSS: Fayl .css gaar ah oo HTML lala xiriiriyo; habkan ayaa ku habboon projects badan.
5. Tusaale HTML + CSS
