style.css
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
body {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  background: #f1f8f8;
  color: #173333;
}
.card {
  max-width: 600px;
  margin: 60px auto;
  padding: 32px;
  background: white;
  border-radius: 12px;
}
h1 { color: #008080; }
a { color: #006666; }
@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .card { margin: 16px; padding: 20px; }
}
6. Erayo muhiim ah
- Selector: Qaybta HTML ee la dooranayo (h1, .card, #id).
- Property: Waxa la beddelayo (color, margin).
- Value: Qiimaha (#008080, 20px).
- Cascade: Xeerarka go'aamiya style-ka shaqaynaya marka xeerar is dul saaran yihiin.
- Specificity: Mid ka mid ah qodobbada lagu kala hormariyo selectors-ka.
- Media Query: Xeer CSS oo style-ka la waafajiya xaaladaha sida ballaca shaashadda.
